      "id": "18783",
      "key": "SFCC-422",
      "summary": "Global-e — Build Headless Payment-Redirect Endpoint",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper checking out via Global-e with a hosted payment method,\nI want\n to be correctly returned to the order confirmation page after completing payment on the provider's site,\nso that\n I receive confirmation of my order instead of a broken or blank checkout experience.\nGlobal-e is confirmed to be a hosted payment page for this project — this is not an edge case. Per the Global-e OCAPI/SCAPI guide, headless implementations require a dedicated endpoint to handle the redirect back from the payment provider, since out-of-the-box handling only covers SiteGenesis/SFRA. No such endpoint currently exists in \ncartridges/plugin_zim_scapi\n. Coordinate with the PWA team on the cookie-persistence half of this flow. See \ndocs/Global-e/ocapi-scapi-gap-analysis.md\n, Outstanding Item #1.",
