  "id": "18595",
  "key": "SFCC-303",
  "summary": "VIC Exclusive Product Visibility",
  "description": "As a Site Merchandiser, \n\nI want to flag a product as VIC Exclusive in Business Manager, \n\nso that only VIC customers can see it on the storefront regardless of which categories it belongs to.\n\n----\n\nVIC Exclusive is a badge (part of [SFCC-225](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-225) )\n\nBut also, products can be marked as VIC Exclusive - which means only customers in the VIC Exclusive customer group have visibility on these products.\n\nThere are 6-8 styles on average per season that are VIC Exclusive.\n\nThey do sometimes go to general clients after a while (so we need a way to mark products as no longer VIC Exclusive).",
