  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13826",
      "body": "\\*\\*Solution: VIC Exclusive Product Visibility\\*\\*\nImplement a custom boolean product attribute `isVICExclusive` on the product object, manageable via Business Manager. When set to `true`, the product is restricted to VIC customer group members only.\nVisibility is enforced at two layers:\n- \\*\\*Search (SCAPI hook)\\* — Intercept the product search pipeline and inject a refinement filter that excludes `isVICExclusive = true` products for any session where the customer does not belong to the VIC customer group.\n- \\*\\*PDP (controller guard)\\* — On direct URL access, check the session customer group server-side and return a 404 (or redirect) if the customer is not VIC-eligible, preventing product discovery via shared links or crawlers.\nThe `isVICExclusive` attribute is set per-product in BM and propagated to the search index via standard re-indexing. No catalog restructuring required.\n[TSD VIC Exclusive Product Visibility](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/407666693/TSDVICExclusiveProductVisibility)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Victor T. Crisostomo",
