      "body": "## Spike Update — TSD-SFCC-241 v0.2 (03 Aug 2026)\nFull spike findings document attached: \\*\\*TSD-SFCC-241\\_MuleSoft\\_Sync\\_Continuation\\_v02.docx\\*\\*\nThis continues from SFCC-121 (Victor Crisostomo, 24 Jul 2026), incorporating the Tryzens API Details Excel and the Omneo/MuleSoft discovery session transcript.\n----\n### What's been confirmed ✔\n|Area|Confirmed|\n|---|---|\n|Product|Magento pulls AP21 directly (6h delta  weekly full). For SFCC, MuleSoft API will be used per the Catalogue Sync TSD. Delta enhancement agreed: return changed fields only.|\n|Inventory|Real-time: `GET .../api/find-in-store` · Scheduled push: `POST .../rest/V1/inventorysync` every 5 min (NewStore regions)|\n|Orders|`GET .../api/orders`, {{GET .../api/orders/{id}?id\\_type=internal}}, `GET .../api/returns` — payloads provided in ZIP|\n|Orders|Boutique orders are surfaced via GET order history — \\*\\*not\\*\\* written into Magento's order table|\n|Architecture|MuleSoft is the sole intermediary between SFCC and Omneo. No direct SFCC ↔ Omneo connections.|\n|Profile sync|PATCH upsert agreed for SFCC → MuleSoft → Omneo. Minimal sync only (core fields). Addresses on-demand.|\n----\n### Gaps still outstanding 🔴\n\\*\\*CRITICAL — blocks build:\\*\\*\n- \\*\\*P-2 (OQ-2):\\* MuleSoft product API endpoint for SFCC not provided. Blocks SFCC-33. Chase Tryzens (Simi/Ganga).\n- \\*\\*PR-3 (OQ-4):\\* MuleSoft pricing endpoint not provided. Blocks SFCC-35. Chase Tryzens.\n- \\*\\*O-1 (OQ-8):\\* Order creation webhook (`ordercreated`) full endpoint URL not confirmed. Blocks order submission flow.\n- \\*\\*C-1 to C-4 (OQ-11):\\* Entire customer data flow (registration, profile change, boutique interaction, diagram) not documented by Tryzens.\n- \\*\\*AP21 Person ID creation:\\* How MuleSoft creates the AP21 Person ID without going through Omneo's proxy is unresolved. Owner: Danny, Simon, Billy — offline discussion required.\n\\*\\*HIGH — needs follow-up:\\*\\*\n- \\*\\*P-1 (OQ-1):\\* Product attribute transformation rules (HTML stripping, Vimeo metadata) — Tryzens to share sample AP21 payload.\n- \\*\\*PR-1 (OQ-3):\\* FTP ownership for Global-e pricing CSV not confirmed (Zimmermann vs Adobe/Magento).\n- \\*\\*PR-2 (OQ-4):\\* MuleSoft pricing transform script ownership not confirmed in writing.\n- \\*\\*I-1 (OQ-5):\\* Boutique order stock deduction flow not confirmed in writing.\n- \\*\\*O-2 (OQ-9):\\* Additional order fields written back to Magento post order creation — confirm scope for SFCC replication.\n- \\*\\*O-3/4/5 (OQ-10):\\* Retry logic, post-order data from Mule, email/SMS notification ownership — carry to next Tryzens session.\n\\*\\*INFRASTRUCTURE BLOCKER:\\*\\*\n- Omneo Staging C instance not yet stood up (~1 week from discovery session). Owner: Danny (Omneo).\n- MuleSoft and NewStore Staging C instances not yet stood up. Owner: Zimmermann / MuleSoft team.\n- \\*\\*Endpoint reachability validation cannot begin until both are available.\\*\n----\n### Next actions^TSD-SFCC-241\\*MuleSoft\\*Endpoint\\_Map.docx\n|Owner|Action|\n|---|---|\n|Tryzens (Simi/Ganga)|Share MuleSoft product API endpoint, method, params, sample payload (OQ-1, OQ-2)|\n|Tryzens|Provide MuleSoft pricing endpoint and flow diagram (OQ-4)|\n|Tryzens|Provide full `ordercreated` endpoint URL (OQ-8)|\n|Tryzens|Provide complete customer data flow diagram — Magento ↔ MuleSoft ↔ Omneo (OQ-11)|\n|Danny / Simon / Billy|Resolve AP21 Person ID creation flow via MuleSoft (offline)|\n|Danny (Omneo)|Stand up Omneo Staging C; create admin users for Gus, Tessa, Mani|\n|Zimmermann / MuleSoft team|Stand up MuleSoft  NewStore Staging C instances|\n|Gideon (SFCC)|Complete Salesforce field mapping column in Tryzens data dictionary|",
