  "description": "**As a** Site Admin\n\n**I want** the SFCC search index configured with the correct searchable, refinable, and sortable product attributes across all storefronts,\n\n**so that** all search results, filter panels, and sort options have a reliable, correctly structured data foundation to build on.\n\n----\n\nThis is a foundational configuration story covering the SFCC attribute schema and Athos index configuration only. Synonym dictionaries and search redirect rules are covered in separate stories and depend on this being completed first. No search results page, autocomplete, filter panel, or sorting surface can be built or tested until this work is complete.\n\n## Searchable\n\n|SFCC Attribute|Magento Field|AU|CA-EN|EU-CH|HK|EU|EU-FR|EU-IT|EU-ES|AE-EN|US|UK|\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|`display-name`|`name`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`color`|`colourcode`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|—|\n|`refinementColor`|`color` / `ss_color`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`size`|`size`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`season`|`season`|✓|✓|✓|—|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`story`|`story`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`productSub`|`prodsub`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`category_hierarchy`|`category_hierarchy`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|*(to be named)*|`ss_length_filter`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|*(to be named)*|`ss_material_filter`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|*(to be named)*|`categories_fr` / `category_hierarchy_fr`|—|—|—|—|—|✓|—|—|—|—|—|\n|*(to be named)*|`categories_it` / `category_hierarchy_it`|—|—|—|—|—|—|✓|—|—|—|—|\n|*(to be named)*|`categories_fr_es` / `category_hierarchy_fr_es`|—|—|—|—|—|—|—|✓|—|—|—|\n|`productSub` (FR)|`prodsub_fr`|—|—|—|—|—|✓|—|—|—|—|—|\n|`productSub` (IT)|`prodsub_it`|—|—|—|—|—|—|✓|—|—|—|—|\n|`productSub` (ES)|`prodsub_fr_es`|—|—|—|—|—|—|—|✓|—|—|—|\n\n## Sortable\n\n|SFCC Attribute|Magento Field|AU|CA-EN|EU-CH|HK|EU|EU-FR|EU-IT|EU-ES|AE-EN|US|UK|\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|`display-name`|`name`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|—|\n|`productSub`|`prodsub`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`season`|`season`|—|✓|—|✓|—|—|—|—|—|—|—|\n|`final_price`|`final_price`|—|✓|✓|✓|—|—|—|—|—|—|—|\n|`outOfStockStatus`|`backin_soon_flag`|✓|✓|✓|✓|—|—|—|—|✓|✓|—|\n|`outOfStockStatus`|`coming_soon_flag`|✓|✓|✓|✓|—|—|—|—|✓|✓|—|\n|`newFromDate`|`ss_days_since_created`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`sleeve`|`length_sleeve_filter`|—|—|—|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|*(to be named)*|`material_filter`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|*(to be named)*|`ss_length_filter`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|*(to be named)*|`ss_material_filter`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n\n## Filterable\n\n|SFCC Attribute|Magento Field|AU|CA-EN|EU-CH|HK|EU|EU-FR|EU-IT|EU-ES|AE-EN|US|UK|\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|`outOfStockStatus`|`availability`|✓|—|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|—|✓|\n|`refinementColor`|`ss_color`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`size`|`ss_size`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`size`|`ss_size_accessories`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`size`|`ss_size_shoes`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|`sleeve`|`length_sleeve_filter`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|*(to be named)*|`ss_length_filter`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|*(to be named)*|`ss_material_filter`|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|✓|\n|*(to be named)*|`material_filter_fr`|—|—|—|—|—|✓|—|—|—|—|—|\n|*(to be named)*|`material_filter_it`|—|—|—|—|—|—|✓|—|—|—|—|\n|*(to be named)*|`material_filter_fr_es`|—|—|—|—|—|—|—|✓|—|—|—|",
