      "body": "Hi User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8  — the latest draft is for your review and approval. \n\n[https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/x/BoCrF](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/x/BoCrF) \n\nA few items still need your steer:\n\n1. **Handoff Boundary table** — still marked \"FOR UPDATE,\" per your earlier note that you'd revise it.\n1. **Sprint-2 authoring session with Emma and Dani** — confirming whether this is still planned before we lock the Sprint-2 field sets.\n1. **Cache and graceful degradation stance** — your cache/invalidation concern is still open; the doc currently just accepts a bare page render during a full CDA outage.\n\nOnce we finalize the content, I'll reformat into the prescribed TSD template format.\n\nThanks!\n\nCC: User:712020:26b54c48-03dc-4b75-9a3b-4e924b0a4580 User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac",
