      "id": "13762",
      "body": "Update: **Contentful + SFCC PWA — Integration Status**\nBranch: `spike/contentful-integration`\nSubtask: [SFCC-672](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-672) \ncc: User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8 User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49 \n\nThe core connections are all working end-to-end:\n\n**Studio to PWA** - Studio loads the app in its iframe and the SDK handshake completes cleanly. All 5 custom components show up in the drag-and-drop palette as expected.\n\n**Delivery API to experience route** - Published entries are served at `/<slug>` on MRT dev. You can compose a page in Studio, publish it, and the PWA renders it through `/experience`.\n\n**Delivery API to home page (SSR)** - Hero banner entries are fetched on the server and baked into the HTML before it hits the browser. No client-side flash.\n\n**Webhook receiver** - The PWA is receiving Contentful publish webhooks at the registered endpoint. HMAC verification is in place so we're only processing legitimate requests from Contentful.\n\n!Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 8.33.02 PM.png|width=725,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 8.33.02 PM.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 8.33.30 PM.png|width=725,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 8.33.30 PM.png\"!\n\n!Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 8.33.42 PM.png|width=725,alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-10 at 8.33.42 PM.png\"!",
